    "content": "---\nid: usda_fini_nutrition_incentive\ntitle: \"USDA Food Insecurity Nutrition Incentive (FINI) Grant\"\nfunder: \"USDA Food and Nutrition Service (FNS)\"\nprogram: \"Gus Schumacher Nutrition Incentive Program (GusNIP / FINI)\"\namount: 300000\namountFormatted: \"$300,000\"\ndeadline: \"2026-03-31\"\ndeadlineFormatted: \"March 31, 2026\"\ntier: \"Priority 1 (USDA Food Access)\"\ncategory: \"Federal/USDA\"\nmatchPercentage: 0\ngrantType: \"Federal Nutrition Incentive\"\nportalUrl: \"https://grants.gov\"\nstrategicPriority: \"SNAP/EBT Produce Matching & Multilingual Card System\"\nstatus: \"Drafting\"\n---\n\n# USDA Food Insecurity Nutrition Incentive (FINI) Grant\n\n**Awarding Agency:** USDA National Institute of Food and Agriculture (NIFA) / Food & Nutrition Service  \n**Program:** Gus Schumacher Nutrition Incentive Program (GusNIP / FINI)  \n**Funding Request:** $300,000 (2-Year Project)  \n**Statutory Cost Share:** 0%  \n**Applicant Entity:** Go Austin / Vamos Austin (GAVA)  \n\n---\n\n## 1. Executive Summary\nThe GusNIP/FINI program provides direct point-of-sale subsidies that match SNAP/EBT expenditures dollar-for-dollar when purchasing fresh fruits and vegetables at community-owned retail outlets. Under GAVA's *Vamos Fresco* initiative, SNAP participants receive an instant 50% discount / 1:1 match token, doubling their purchasing power for locally grown produce.\n\n## 2. Program Mechanics & Point-of-Sale Integration\nThe incentive is embedded into the cooperative grocery POS system and linked to an accessible, multilingual resident loyalty card. For every $1 spent in SNAP benefits on fresh produce, the customer receives $1 in *Vamos Bucks* redeemable immediately on additional fresh fruits and vegetables.\n\n## 3. Projected Outcomes\n- $220,000 in direct produce subsidies distributed to low-income East Austin families.\n- 4,000+ unduplicated SNAP households participating.\n- 65,000 lbs of fresh fruits and vegetables purchased.\n",
