    "content": "---\nid: local_cdfi_coop_capital_loan\ntitle: \"CDFI Fund Cooperative Working Capital & Facility Loan/Grant\"\nfunder: \"Local CDFI / CDFI Fund Intermediary\"\nprogram: \"CDFI Technical Assistance & Capital Program\"\namount: 150000\namountFormatted: \"$150,000\"\ndeadline: \"2026-11-30\"\ndeadlineFormatted: \"November 30, 2026\"\ntier: \"Priority 5 (CDFI Debt/Capital)\"\ncategory: \"CDFI Lending & Capital\"\nmatchPercentage: 0\ngrantType: \"Patient Capital & Technical Assistance\"\nportalUrl: \"https://cdfifund.gov\"\nstrategicPriority: \"Retail Storefront Lease Acquisition & POS Infrastructure\"\nstatus: \"Planned\"\n---\n\n# CDFI Fund Cooperative Working Capital & Facility Loan/Grant\n\n**Awarding Agency:** Community Development Financial Institutions (CDFI) Fund  \n**Funding Request:** $150,000 (Technical Assistance Grant)  \n**Associated Debt Capital:** $500,000 Patient Revolving Loan Pool  \n\n---\n\n## 1. Financial Architecture\nPairs technical assistance grant dollars with non-extractive capital from Seed Commons and local credit unions for building acquisition and initial inventory financing.\n",
