    "content": "---\nid: tda_food_bank_distribution\ntitle: \"Texas Department of Agriculture Food Bank Grant Program\"\nfunder: \"Texas Department of Agriculture (TDA)\"\nprogram: \"Texas Food Bank Grant Program\"\namount: 250000\namountFormatted: \"$250,000\"\ndeadline: \"2026-12-31\"\ndeadlineFormatted: \"December 31, 2026\"\ntier: \"Priority 2 (Texas & City Funds)\"\ncategory: \"State of Texas\"\nmatchPercentage: 0\ngrantType: \"State Food Distribution Grant\"\nportalUrl: \"https://texasagriculture.gov\"\nstrategicPriority: \"Community Retail Hub & Food Distribution Partnership\"\nstatus: \"Planned\"\n---\n\n# Texas Department of Agriculture Food Bank Grant Program\n\n**Awarding Agency:** Texas Department of Agriculture (TDA)  \n**Program:** Texas Food Bank & Community Food Access Program  \n**Funding Request:** $250,000  \n**Statutory Match:** 0%  \n**Applicant:** Go Austin / Vamos Austin (GAVA)  \n\n---\n\n## 1. Scope of Work\nEstablishes a hybrid retail-distribution hub combining wholesale supply chain routing with community food pantry integration, ensuring dignity and zero stigma for food-insecure families.\n",
