    "content": "---\nid: acf_community_impact_bipoc\ntitle: \"Austin Community Foundation Community Impact Grant\"\nfunder: \"Austin Community Foundation (ACF)\"\nprogram: \"Community Impact Grants Program\"\namount: 150000\namountFormatted: \"$150,000\"\ndeadline: \"2027-01-15\"\ndeadlineFormatted: \"January 15, 2027\"\ntier: \"Priority 3 (Health Equity Foundations)\"\ncategory: \"Regional Foundation\"\nmatchPercentage: 0\ngrantType: \"Regional Foundation Grant\"\nportalUrl: \"https://austincf.org\"\nstrategicPriority: \"Multilingual Resident-Owner Leadership Academy\"\nstatus: \"Planned\"\n---\n\n# Austin Community Foundation Community Impact Grant\n\n**Awarding Agency:** Austin Community Foundation (ACF)  \n**Program:** Community Impact Grants (Economic Mobility Portfolio)  \n**Funding Request:** $150,000  \n**Focus:** BIPOC and immigrant community leadership in democratic enterprise  \n\n---\n\n## 1. Program Strategy\nFunds stipends, bilingual translation, and leadership cohorts for 60 resident leaders who guide the governance and community ownership of the grocery co-op.\n",
